              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye mam iyatanakinos noi, naarai ideleleuni akecebaŋaanut kotuŋa kere, kwape kideleleunio abaŋaanut naka ŋul kaluarei.",
